# `columns N on SIZE` casts N with [int] (Read-OtterUiElementStatement):
# numbers round half to even, true is 1, hexadecimal text converts, and a
# number too big for [int] is PowerShell's conversion error, reported as a
# syntax error at the end of the line.
say "never runs"
card "x"
    columns 2.5 on small
    columns true on medium
    columns "0x10" on large
    columns "1,000" on wide
card "y"
    columns 30000000000 on medium
